flowchart TD
    A[User SearchProfile] --> B[SourceSubscription]
    B --> C[Recalculate shared SourceSchedule]
    C --> D[Minimum preferred interval across enabled profiles]

    E[Scheduler Tick] --> F[Recover stale RUNNING worker locks]
    F --> G[Load due SourceSchedule rows]
    D --> G

    G --> H{Enabled, active and not paused?}
    H -- No --> Z[Ignore]
    H -- Yes --> I[Atomically advance nextRunAt]
    I --> J{Active run already exists?}
    J -- Yes --> Z
    J -- No --> K[Create QUEUED AcquisitionRun]

    K --> L[Worker claims run]
    L --> M[RUNNING + worker lock]
    M --> N[Acquisition Dispatcher]

    N --> O{Mode / executor result}
    O --> P[COMPLETED]
    O --> Q[PARTIAL]
    O --> R[FAILED]
    O --> S[RATE_LIMITED]
    O --> T[CHALLENGED]
    O --> U[SKIPPED until Milestone 5 collector exists]

    P --> V[Update SourceHealth]
    Q --> V
    R --> V
    S --> V
    T --> V

    V --> W{Repeated failure or challenge?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Open circuit + pausedUntil]
    W -- No --> Y[Keep source scheduled]
    X --> AA[Cooldown or source-owner resume]
    AA --> Y
